M09_Mobius_Suit_Objective midtro reposition fallback. X9C_MIDTRO.txt line
361 (Send_Custom 2000612 8888) is the only thing that moves Havoc and Mobius
from their +7 m hold to the authored points 1100497/2002239. If it never
arrives (control file fails to open or the controller dies early), make the
same move 20 s (sim time) after the cinematic starts and log once. When 8888
arrives (12.0 s) the flag is set and the timer does nothing.

